WHAT THE REAL DOCUMENT SHOWED
Duo Tax schedule #398034, 56 Forbes Street Croydon Park. Settlement,
purchase and rental start all 27/10/2025. Pre-1987 construction. Totals:
Capital Works (Div 43) $92,768, Plant & Equipment (Div 40) $9,896.

Year 1 (27/10/25 - 30/06/26):
  Capital works      $1,402   (identical on BOTH method pages)
  Plant & equipment  $555 diminishing value / $277 prime cost

Two design decisions were validated by the real document:
1. RECORD, DO NOT DERIVE. The full-year capital works claim is $2,424, but
   2.5% of $92,768 is $2,319. The schedule is a blend of components with
   different start dates and remaining lives (p.8 "Date of structural
   improvement - See Page 22"). A derived figure would have been wrong.
2. PER-ITEM CLOCKS. The blend is exactly the multi-component model the
   Div 43 register uses.

