KEY INVARIANTS ESTABLISHED
- Div 43 is per item on its own clock, life = 100/rate (40 years at 2.5%,
  25 at 4%), each year prorated by days on foot, cumulative capped at cost.
- Portfolio totals are SUMMED from per-property schedules, never recomputed.
  Tested: portfolio net == sum of property nets == gross rent less
  deductions. A portfolio figure that disagreed with the schedules behind
  it would be worse than none.
- Aggregation copies line objects before accumulating, so summing a
  schedule cannot corrupt the per-property view the pack also prints.

